{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863030/extras/19cc7c1cc4c9d0237610e68d71dbf141.poster.avif?t=1769383432\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863030/extras/19cc7c1cc4c9d0237610e68d71dbf141.webm?t=1769383432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863030/extras/19cc7c1cc4c9d0237610e68d71dbf141.mp4?t=1769383432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME WHAT YOU CAPTURE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mate'Morphosis is a <strong>chess puzzle game</strong> about navigating <strong>ONE PIECE</strong> to capture queen. It is all about turning into the piece you just took. Every capture changes how you move, so you plan few turn ahead and plot sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863030/extras/391ed225103b7b602066a8348c01f8d4.poster.avif?t=1769383432\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863030/extras/391ed225103b7b602066a8348c01f8d4.webm?t=1769383432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863030/extras/391ed225103b7b602066a8348c01f8d4.mp4?t=1769383432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MORPH NOW &amp; Much More</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morph</strong> - Pawns become knights, knights become bishops; your route evolves with every move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving mechanics</strong> - Fresh mechanics beyond chess keep boards surprising from start to Mate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-crafted challenge</strong> - tight levels with a steady difficulty climb and clean, readable pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant learning loop</strong> - quick restarts and fast pacing make puzzle experience painless.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play your way</strong> - <span class=\"bb_strike\">A lot potential moves</span>.\u00a0<u><i>well kinda</i></u><i>.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863030/extras/1e89efeedcc5dbe8a6e5ba59fbf8ca3d.poster.avif?t=1769383432\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863030/extras/1e89efeedcc5dbe8a6e5ba59fbf8ca3d.webm?t=1769383432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863030/extras/1e89efeedcc5dbe8a6e5ba59fbf8ca3d.mp4?t=1769383432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Once Wise Monke Said:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pawns dream of becoming knights, and I dream bananas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Play For The First Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863030/a57d36b486faf7c6bd073db21f86f509161b823b.jpg"},{"name":"Finish The Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3863030/c7e7e84a3b42a77f7f00e2dbabdb78